WEBVTT

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:06.310
Would you mind explaining that,
Setsuna Yuki-san?

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.530
You're not going to even try to deny it?

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:15.820
Well, I never thought
I'd be able to hide it forever.

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:21.500
But I never thought someone outside of
the School Idol Club would find me out.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.830
I just happened to have
a really good friend in the club.

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:29.590
Though I'm pretty interested as to why
the student council president was hiding

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.630
her true identity to be a school idol...

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:36.140
I don't think that's what these girls
want to hear right now.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:37.890
Setsuna-chan...

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:45.140
You said we were just taking a short break.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.810
Did you already make up your mind
when the group disbanded?

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:50.570
That you were done with us...

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:52.030
Setsuna-chan!

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:54.360
Setsuna Yuki no longer exists!

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:59.370
I quit being a school idol.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:03.580
If all of you want to continue
being school idols...

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:06.210
If you intend on getting to Love Live...

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.790
Please continue without me.

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:18.260
<i>Let's go to the future!</i>
<i>Rainbow melodies</i>

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:23.470
"Nijigasaki High School Idol Club"
"Love Live!"

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:31.020
<i>The rain clears up and reveals blue skies</i>

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:34.030
<i>The winds of hope blow (Blowing)</i>

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:38.950
<i>We can feel something coming</i>
<i>and we take our very first step</i>

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:41.700
<i>The world is sparkling</i>

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.700
<i>And our hearts start to
well up with (Feelings)</i>

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:49.080
<i>"We want to start running right now!!"</i>
<i>(Move on! Move on!)</i>

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:54.590
<i>The tiny melodies blend together (Our Colors)</i>

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:56.800
<i>Let's paint this arch, now</i>

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:00.390
<i>It resonates throughout the city</i>
<i>(Reaching for far blue sky!)</i>

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:02.550
<i>Let's sing together!</i>

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:08.350
<i>My feelings are overflowing,</i>
<i>there's no stopping them now</i>

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:11.020
<i>Rainbow-colored passions!!</i>

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.230
<i>Colors painted in courage</i>

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.900
<i>Let's create a bridge to the future</i>

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:19.360
<i>Beyond the endless sky</i>

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.700
<i>Resounding sympathy</i>

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.080
<i>Miracles are blooming</i>

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:27.290
<i>--Let's go! Shine towards
the future, melodies</i>

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:29.710
<i>--Yes, I know I'm not alone</i>

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:32.380
<i>You're all always by my side</i>

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:38.420
<i>So let's connect our dreams together</i>

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:44.930
I just wanted to shout out my love

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.230
and I ended up hurting someone else.

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:52.940
That wasn't who I wanted to be.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.190
That's why...

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.540
Nana, I'm coming in.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.370
C-Come in.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.790
Are your studies going well?

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.250
Of course.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:16.500
Your mock exams are
next week, right? Do your best.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:17.710
Mm.

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.010
All right.

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:25.390
I will talk to them about using
the gymnasium after school hours.

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:27.180
Thank you.

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.810
Do we have any other matters to discuss?

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:29.980
Yes.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:34.560
It appears that we have a troublemaker
that's been living at the school.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.900
And who might that be?

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.190
Hold it right there!

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.780
Hold it!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:46.660
Hey, stop! Please, just stop!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.460
You've got nowhere to run...

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:01.380
You're Rina Tennoji-san. A first-year
taking the information processing course.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.630
Please hand that cat over.

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:04.800
No.

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:10.020
That kitty was abandoned near the school.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:13.730
Neither of us have been
able to take them home.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:17.940
It is against school regulations
to let animals run around the school.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:28.780
It appears that cat is
rather fond of you, Tennoji-san.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:32.830
What's their name?

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:04.190
Why are you playing that song?

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.910
Ack! The student council president?!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:12.660
Yu Takasaki-san, did you get
permission to use this music room?

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.710
No, I, uh...

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.290
I'm sorry!

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.840
I just felt like playing that song...

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:25.050
But I guess it's not
possible on the first try.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:29.260
By the way, you sounded like
you know Setsuna-chan's songs!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.260
--Huh?
--Isn't "CHASE" just so amazing?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:35.270
Did you see the video? Wait, are you
a fan of Setsuna-chan, too?!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:38.560
Jeez, why didn't you just say so?!

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.310
Let's talk all about Setsuna-chan!

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.480
Oh, I know!

00:05:41.480 --> 00:05:44.400
If you have any video recommendations
other than "CHASE," could you let me know?

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.950
I've been looking but
haven't been able to find any!

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.780
Y-You're too close!

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:51.910
Oh... My bad.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:57.120
Now that I think about it, you were looking
for Yuki-<i>san </i>the other day when we met.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.540
Yeah! I love her!

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:06.420
She put on a performance the other day
and it was just amazing!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:11.300
Setsuna-chan's words just
pierced my heart, you know?

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:15.520
I've never been so moved by a song before!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:21.940
I've never been able to be
so passionate about anything.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.780
But ever since that day,
I've been hooked on school idols

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.700
and I'm having so much fun!

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:30.820
Ayumu and I even joined the School Idol Club!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.200
The School Idol Club?

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:35.450
Yeah, Kasumi-chan invited us.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.450
Oh...

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:40.830
W-Wait! It's not like we started up
the club without permission...

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.670
I don't see an issue here.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:48.510
The School Idol Club had
disbanded previously,

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:52.760
but there's no rule stating that
it cannot be reestablished.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.720
Whenever you are able to
gather five or more members,

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:58.980
please come see me for
the official paperwork.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:00.810
Okay...

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:06.730
I'm sure Yuki-san would be happy
to hear about that.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:09.110
I really hope so.

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:15.240
I wonder why Setsuna-chan quit.

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:20.790
I know there's no point
in me dwelling on it, though.

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:25.040
I'm sure Setsuna-chan's thought it through.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:31.010
But I just think to myself sometimes...

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.800
If that performance wasn't the end

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:37.430
and was actually just the beginning,
wouldn't that be the best?

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.270
Why would you say something like that?

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.600
Huh?

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.100
That was a very fitting final performance.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:48.360
Setsuna-san was right
for ending things there.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:53.320
If she had continued, she would have
continued to hurt the other club members.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:57.080
And the School Idol Club
would've never recovered.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:58.620
Huh? I don't think that's...

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:02.580
Takasaki-san, have you
heard of the Love Live?

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:08.170
That's like the national competition
for school idols, right?

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.880
Precisely.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:15.840
The Love Live is the ultimate stage
for school idols and their fans.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:18.180
If you're a fan of Setsuna-san,

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:20.720
you would've wanted her
to perform there, right?

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:23.810
Setsuna-san also loved school idols.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:27.690
That's why she created
the School Idol Club, formed a group,

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:32.820
and wanted to compete with other groups
from around the country.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:38.120
To win, all the members
needed to become one color.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.540
But the more she tried
to bring everyone together,

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.750
the more they butted heads.

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:49.130
And then she realized...
that she was the cause of it all.

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:55.970
Setsuna-san's love was
nothing more than her being selfish.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:04.940
The fact that she even tried to
become a school idol was wrong.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:08.480
Do you feel disenchanted now?

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.740
Yu-chan?

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:22.660
If you'll excuse me.

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:41.890
"Setsuna Yuki LIVE@ Odaiba"

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.560
"She's so good..." "Awesome!!" "But
I heard she quit" "Why, though?"

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:49.770
"Taka" "1 day ago" "But I heard she quit"

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:52.190
"Suzuki" "1 day ago"
"Why, though?"

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:54.360
"ryoi" "1 day ago"
"What a waste"

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:56.530
"So she's not entering the Love Live?"
"She would've probably made it really far, too"

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.990
"She would've probably
made it really far, too"

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.790
I didn't dislike having people
expect certain things from me,

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:08.250
but I wanted to do at least
one thing that I loved.

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.420
You all love school idols, right?

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.000
You want to be one, right?

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:17.090
We won't be able to fully express our love
to the fans with a performance like this!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:18.840
But!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.930
This isn't cute at all!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.930
Who cares about passion?

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:27.940
I want to concentrate on being cute!

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:33.360
What I loved was getting in the way
of what someone else loved.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:37.280
So basically, I was just being selfish.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:42.830
Not only was what I loved
not getting through to the fans,

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:45.580
it wasn't even getting through to my friends.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:56.260
If the performance I did to settle things

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:59.720
helps the School Idol Club even a little...

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:07.310
Let Setsuna Yuki be the
only one to disappear...

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.020
--Yu-senpai!

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.810
--And let a brand new Nijigasaki
High School Idol Club be born.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:14.980
Hey.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:18.940
That is my final selfish wish.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:26.990
What?! That mean ol' student council
president is Setsuna-senpai?!

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:32.210
Or rather, why did you leave me behind
to have such an important discussion?

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:34.750
You even took that outsider lady!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.500
Wow...

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:39.470
She has quite the mouth on her, doesn't she?

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:43.550
I'm sorry! I'll give you this bun,
so please forgive me!

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:48.020
My, this looks delicious.

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:50.480
Don't mind if I do.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:53.520
We couldn't find you anywhere in the school,

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:56.270
so we left a message on your phone.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.150
Huh? Really?

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.820
I didn't notice at all!

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:04.950
So it was Nana-san.

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:10.040
It seems Setsuna-chan really wants
to quit being a school idol.

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:15.710
We tried talking to her,
but we just couldn't get through to her.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.050
I see...

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:23.630
Is there a problem?

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:29.720
It looks like all of you have
already reached your goal.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.440
You seem to have more than five members

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.900
and since the student
council is okay with it,

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:40.110
you'd be able to start up
your club again today, right?

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:44.820
She said she wanted to quit herself,

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:48.240
so there's no point in
trying to stop her, is there?

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:52.500
Does she really want to quit though?

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.540
What makes you think otherwise?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.210
What do you all think?

00:12:57.210 --> 00:13:00.210
Do you want Setsuna-chan to quit?

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:02.300
Of course not!

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:06.680
Setsuna-chan is such a wonderful school idol.

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:11.390
One of the reasons we went on hiatus
is because we couldn't keep up...

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:17.600
Even though Emma and I are the oldest,
we just couldn't lead everyone...

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.860
The debut performance came and went,

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:24.450
but we all practiced hard
to be on that stage together.

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:27.320
There's no way we can do this
without Setsuna-san.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:29.620
I agree!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:33.040
We definitely need Setsuna-senpai!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:37.540
I mean, she was really rough on us,

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:42.130
but I think I sort of know how she felt now.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:45.420
I don't want the same thing to happen again,

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:49.180
but there should be a way around it.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:50.850
And to figure that out,

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:56.480
I think we need Setsuna-senpai
who's the exact opposite of me.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:14:00.310
Aw, you've grown so much, Kasumi-chan.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.480
--Are you making fun of me?
--There, there.

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:05.650
No, I really meant that.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:11.660
Setsuna-chan is who gave us
our dreams. I want to do this, too.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:13.370
Yeah.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:17.870
But this all comes down to how she feels.

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:21.500
Why do you have to keep ruining everything?

00:14:21.500 --> 00:14:24.920
Well, Karin-chan is right.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:31.050
Hey! May I go talk to her?

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:37.520
Congrats on becoming the student council's
official trekking officer, Hanpen.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:38.980
Congratulations.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:41.230
Isn't that great, Rinari?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.400
Yeah.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:44.110
We can't officially keep them,

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.440
but having them join the school

00:14:46.440 --> 00:14:48.700
apparently doesn't go against
school regulations.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:51.910
I call BS, but I'll happily accept this BS.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:55.950
Yeah. The student council
president is a nice person.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.420
That's all for today.

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:02.170
Good job, everyone.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:07.210
General curriculum second-years
Nana Nakagawa-san and

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.720
Setsuna Yuki-san.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.800
Please come to the roof
of the west building immediately.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:15.560
President, they're calling for you.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.310
I'll go see what this is about.

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:19.100
"On Air"

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.640
Thanks.

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:23.060
Here're the goods we promised.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.900
Kasumi-chan...

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:30.450
They went through the trouble of
summoning Setsuna with me...

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.530
Could it be Emma-san?

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:35.660
No, it was probably Asaka-san...

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.130
Yu Takasaki-san...

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:51.840
Hey, Setsuna-chan.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:57.470
I guess Emma-san and the others told you.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:15:59.350
They did, but...

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:04.520
I had a feeling this might be the case
during our chat in the music room.

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.780
So, what did you want?

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.240
I'm sorry!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.870
Where did that come from?

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:23.170
I ended up asking why you quit
being a school idol yesterday.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:25.420
I was way too insensitive.

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.710
I'm not worried about it.

00:16:29.710 --> 00:16:33.050
It's my fault for concealing my identity.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.600
If we're done talking...

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:41.020
No, wait! There's more!

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.850
Yes?

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:47.150
I wasn't... I wasn't disenchanted!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:54.410
I want you to return to the School Idol Club
as a school idol, Setsuna-chan.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.160
What are you...

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.710
You understand then, don't you?!

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:07.420
If I'm in the club, I'm just
going to hold everyone back!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:11.550
If I return, they won't be able
to go to the Love Live!

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.420
Then...

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.590
Then you don't need to
appear in the Love Live!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:24.390
Well, I mean, I don't think it's
the Love Live that matters here...

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:30.480
I just don't like that you aren't
able to be happy, Setsuna-chan.

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:34.700
You don't have to stand on
the ultimate stage like the Love Live.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:38.490
If I get to hear your songs,
that's all that matters to me.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:43.790
There are school idols
and they have their fans.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:45.750
Isn't that more than enough?

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:51.750
But why would you like someone like me?

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.920
I told you, didn't I?

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:59.760
I love you. You're the one who
made me feel like this, Setsuna-chan.

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:05.980
I've never met anyone like you.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:12.110
I don't dislike having people
expecting things from me.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.820
But...

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:17.950
Are you really sure about this?

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.990
Are you saying it's okay
for me to be selfish...

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:27.710
For me to see what I love through to the end?

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.000
Of course!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.550
Do you know what you just did?

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:47.270
You actually said something much more
profound than you probably realize.

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:54.690
Don't blame me for what happens later.

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:00.740
This song is for a new beginning!

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:02.900
I'm a proud member of the
Nijigasaki High School Idol Club!

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:05.070
My name is Setsuna Yuki!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:16.460
Setsuna-chan!

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:17.880
OMG, I love you so much!

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.630
H-Hey!

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:28.680
Thank you...

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:32.390
Senpai, how long are you
going to cling to her like that?

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.730
You really are amazing.

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:36.520
Yeah.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:39.150
You were all watching?

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.740
Welcome back.

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:46.280
You know... You might've
hyped everyone up too much.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:51.120
If the teachers find out,
you might get yelled at.

00:21:51.120 --> 00:21:54.330
What should we do, Student Council President?

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:59.210
I'm Setsuna Yuki right now!

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:01.800
Let's get out of here before they find us!

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:03.760
Yeah!

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:22.610
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:26.490
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:33.330
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:40.080
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:22:40.080 --> 00:22:46.720
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:46.720 --> 00:22:49.010
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:49.010 --> 00:22:53.470
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:53.470 --> 00:23:01.560
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:05.940
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:09.030
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:13.530
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:23:13.530 --> 00:23:16.160
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:19.420
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:23:19.420 --> 00:23:22.580
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:27.880
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:32.090
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:39.350
Next time, "The Uncharted Path."

00:23:46.980 --> 00:23:58.500
"Nijigasaki School Idol Club"
"Love Live!"
